      "ArticleTitle": "A small molecule angiotensin II type 2 receptor (AT\u2082R) antagonist produces analgesia in a rat model of neuropathic pain by inhibition of p38 mitogen-activated protein kinase (MAPK) and p44/p42 MAPK activation in the dorsal root ganglia.",
